0,List of unclassified languages of South America - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_unclassified_languages_of_South_America,"The following purported languages of South America are listed as unclassified in either Campbell (2024), Loukotka (1968), Ethnologue, or Glottolog. Nearly all are extinct. It is likely that many of them were not actually distinct languages, only ethnic or regional names.",Tingui-Boto,Unclassified
